{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Art of Solitaire</strong> flips classic card games with chill vibes to keep your mind happy. Every game is a colourful art trip where you discover and build decks, designed by real-world (fierce as FLICK) indie artists!</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690460/extras/2a3894a9bc51e0e3adcfa5bdd3af27bd.poster.avif?t=1769712675\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690460/extras/2a3894a9bc51e0e3adcfa5bdd3af27bd.webm?t=1769712675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690460/extras/2a3894a9bc51e0e3adcfa5bdd3af27bd.mp4?t=1769712675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Art of Solitaire is solitaire in full slay mode. Play classic games like Klondike, Spider, and Pyramid, powered by jaw-dropping indie art from </strong><strong><i>real</i></strong><strong> artists, killer animations, and a vibe that hits every single time. Whether you\u2019ve got 3 minutes or 3 hours, it\u2019s pure solo bliss\u2014just you, the cards, and zero distractions.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690460/extras/b4b7e746dffa6a0d1496dd8a83dc0a73.poster.avif?t=1769712675\" width=616 height=217 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690460/extras/b4b7e746dffa6a0d1496dd8a83dc0a73.webm?t=1769712675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>From Ugly Medieval Cats to fire-breathing dragons, Art of Solitaire\u2019s decks are loaded with personality. We\u2019ve partnered with legends like Cyanide &amp; Happiness (Explosm), Kennys\u2019 GIFS, and a whole squad of indie creators, each bringing their signature style to the table. Open packs, score new cards, and discover which artists you\u2019ll unlock next. With over 60 creators and new designs rolling out each month, your game is as unique as your vibe.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690460/extras/1dd92165c622be8b10bd66fd419c6385.poster.avif?t=1769712675\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690460/extras/1dd92165c622be8b10bd66fd419c6385.webm?t=1769712675\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690460/extras/1dd92165c622be8b10bd66fd419c6385.mp4?t=1769712675\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Chill</strong>\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Art of Solitaire is all about chill vibes and zero pressure. No timers, no \u201clast person standing\u201d nonsense \u2014 just you, the cards, and a smooth rhythm that lets your brain hit the reset button. Whether you're melting away stress or winding down for the night, Art of Solitaire is your perfect escape. Grab some headspace and get in the zone with games that are as relaxing as they are fun \u2014 because life\u2019s better after a good FLICK.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3690460?t=1769712675","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3690460?t=1769712675","capsule_image