or the night, Art of Solitaire is your perfect escape. Grab some headspace and get in the zone with games that are as relaxing as they are fun \u2014 because life\u2019s better after a good FLICK.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Flick"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3690460/4558cb0b535681031e87b68a453d041f88af3db5/header.jpg?t=1769712675","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"Art of Solitaire \u00a9 2020-2026 Flick Games Ltd. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3690460/725310823/2de7838f846c9fb65150ece631ee1a5ba145ae7c/1760525229/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760533770","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3690460/725310823/2de7838f846c9fb65150ece631ee1a5ba145ae7c/1760525229/dash_h264.mpd?t=1760533770","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3690460/725310823/2de7838f846c9fb65150ece631ee1a5ba145ae7c/1760525229/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1760533770","id":257218237,"name":"Early Access Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257218237/6602a169800a373ecb205b248ae2ec50485644eb/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1760533770"}],"name":"Art of Solitaire","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Win 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 950<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Flick"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated"